# panel fixture: the PIT knob turned counter-clockwise lowers the pitch offset, which may be negative
# manual: p015
# workflow: Step zoom, step attributes
# p015: "step pitch may be a positive or negative offset relative to the base track pitch."
given step 3 5 pit = 1
at 0 ms press mode.step
at 200 ms click step(3,5)
at 400 ms release mode.step
at 1000 ms turn edit.enc.pit -4
expect command SetStep track=3 step=4 attr=PitchOffset value=-3
expect commands 1
expect engine step 3 5 pit = -3
